            "review_title": "Review at Nha Hang 241",
            "review_text": "BJWK\nLos Angeles, California33 contributions\n1\nsurprisingly good.\nSep 2019 • Family\nas i walked in, i felt like a stranger being a token non-vietnamese. having stayed in five other cities in vietnam prior (with growing suspicions), i expected to be presented with a higher price (english) menu; well, i was wrong and i was pleasantly surprised by two things: great quality (actually live) seafood and efforts put in by their manager to leave a good impression of their restaurant on foreigners. bottom line, this appears to be a solid restaurant with ample local customers which does not necessarily need rip off foreigners to increase their top line. i would recommend their marinated live seafood dishes. reasonably priced so relax and try.\nRead more\nWritten September 3, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
